@startuml hix-flujo-localizacion
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Verdana
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #999999
  ParticipantBorderColor #555555
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  GroupBorderColor #999999
}

participant "Consumidor" as C
participant "Authorization\nServer" as AS
participant "Record Locator\nService" as RLS
participant "Registro de\nidentidad maestra" as PMIR
participant "Document\nRegistry" as REG
participant "Directorio" as DIR
participant "Custodio" as K

== Localización ==
C -> AS : [ITI-71] Get Access Token
AS --> C : token (audiencia: RLS)
C -> RLS : [ITI-67] Find Document References\n(patient) [ITI-72]
RLS -> AS : [ITI-102] Introspect Token
AS --> RLS : activo, organización, propósito
RLS -> PMIR : [ITI-83] identidad maestra
PMIR --> RLS : identidad maestra
RLS -> AS : [HIX-1] intercambio\n(resource = Document Registry)
AS --> RLS : JWT (aud = registro, sub = consumidor,\nact = RLS, vida ≤ 120 s)
RLS -> REG : [ITI-67] [ITI-72]
REG --> RLS : punteros
RLS -> RLS : decisión de divulgación por puntero\nURL de contenido → RLS
RLS --> C : Bundle de punteros divulgados

== Recuperación ==
C -> RLS : [ITI-68] Retrieve Document\n(URL del RLS) [ITI-72]
RLS -> AS : [ITI-102] Introspect Token
RLS -> RLS : relee el puntero\nrecomprueba la divulgación
RLS -> DIR : [ITI-90] custodio → endpoint
DIR --> RLS : endpoint activo del custodio
RLS -> AS : [HIX-1] Custodian Token Exchange\n(resource = custodio)
AS --> RLS : JWT (aud = custodio, sub = consumidor,\nact = RLS, vida ≤ 120 s)
RLS -> K : [ITI-68] Retrieve Document [ITI-72]
K -> K : validación local del JWT
alt el custodio responde
  K --> RLS : documento
  RLS --> C : documento
else el custodio no responde
  RLS --> C : OperationOutcome (transitorio)
end
note over C, K : Cada llamada del RLS a un servicio central o a un custodio va precedida de un intercambio [HIX-1] a nombre del solicitante; se muestra solo donde importa.\nCada actor registra sus eventos [ITI-20] bajo el identificador de correlación de la operación.
@enduml
